{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-verbs-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T10:22:42.887Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3424b2678dd384ebb3081643c402005e9e1f881aa31e8d483662393550062652","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@june.osei-lark: I've set up the weekday 17:30 'Pod end of day' note for #strategic-pod. It will list each day's new messages here. Two caveats: the scheduler is not running yet, so nothing will post until it is started, and its next run shows as Mon 26 Oct 17:30 UTC, not today at 17:30 Chicago time, so the first run may not be today. I'll flag that to whoever runs the scheduler. Finance figures will be left out of the note."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
